+## Required production configuration
+
+Before shipping official builds, set:
+
+```gn
+browser_express_crash_upload_url = "https://<owned-crash-endpoint>/..."
+browser_express_crash_product = "BrowserExpress_Android"
+```
+
+Do not set this URL to Brave or Google crash ingestion. The GN assertions are
+intended to fail fast if inherited endpoints are accidentally used.
+
